 "profile": {
  "name": "Hedon139",
  "nameKo": "헤돈139",
  "tagline": "Hedon is Everywhere",
  "genre": "Romantic Punk · Graffiti & Neo-Pop Art",
  "crew": "Unlimited Crew",
  "manifesto": "Love is sweet.\nLove bites.",
  "statement": [
   "나는 학창시절, 남자아이들이 파란 크레파스를 들 때 혼자 핑크색을 들던 아이였다. 특별한 이유는 없었다. 그냥 핑크가 더 예뻐 보였기 때문이다.",
   "가면라이더와 애니메이션, 홍대에서 랩을 하던 사람들. 단순히 멋있어 보였고, 그 뒤에 서 있던 그래피티가 눈에 들어왔다. 집에 있던 락카를 별생각 없이 집어 들고 방에 그림을 그린 순간이 시작이었다.",
   "그래피티를 배우며 벽의 금을 보수하던 경험에서 출발해, 이제는 퍼티와 젤스톤, 모델링 페이스트로 크랙이 살아 있는 바탕을 만든다. 서브컬처와 그래피티, 애니메이션적인 캐릭터성과 거리의 질감을 한 화면에 섞는다.",
   "내 작업에는 아기 천사 '헨젤'과 아기 악마 '헤빌'이 등장한다. 둘은 선과 악을 나누기 위한 존재가 아니라, 한 존재 안에 공존하는 두 가지 상태다. 사랑도 그렇고, 사람도 그렇다. 작품 속 스티커와 낙서들은 그 사이를 오가는 경험과 관계, 환경을 의미한다.",
   "내 이름 '헤돈(Hedon)'은 쾌락주의(Hedonism)에서 따왔다. 쾌락은 단순한 자극이 아니라 일상 속에서 느끼는 작은 행복이라는 생각이 좋았다. 나는 내가 행복하기 위해, 내가 좋아하는 것을 그린다. 그게 전부다."
  ],
  "instagram": {
   "handle": "@hedonhideul139",
   "url": "https://www.instagram.com/hedonhideul139"
  },
  "portrait": "images/about-portrait.jpg",
  "genreEn": "Romantic Punk: Graffiti × Neo-Pop Art",
  "basedIn": "Seoul, South Korea",
  "statementEn": [
   "I was the kid who reached for the pink crayon while the other boys picked up blue. There was no special reason. Pink simply looked better to me.",
   "Kamen Rider and animation, the rappers who used to freestyle in Hongdae — they looked cool, and behind them I noticed the graffiti. I picked up a spray can that was lying around at home and painted my room. That moment was the beginning.",
   "Learning graffiti came with repairing the cracks in walls, and that is still where my surfaces begin: putty, gelstone and modeling paste build a ground that keeps the crack alive. Subculture, graffiti, cartoon-like characters and the texture of the street are mixed into a single picture.",
   "My paintings are inhabited by Hanzel, a baby angel, and Hevil, a baby demon. They are not there to separate good from evil; they are two states that coexist inside one being — as love does, and as people do. The stickers and scribbles across the work stand for the experiences, relationships and surroundings that move between them.",
   "The name Hedon comes from Hedonism. I liked the thought that pleasure is not simply stimulation but the small happiness we find in everyday life. I paint what I love, because I want to be happy. That is all of it."
  ],
  "bioEn": "Hedon139 (헤돈139) is a Seoul-based artist working in Romantic Punk: graffiti spray, neo-pop colour and subculture characters on surfaces built up with putty, gelstone and modeling paste. The name joins Hedon — from Hedonism, pleasure as the small happiness of everyday life — with 139, the height he measured when he first started drawing. A member of Unlimited Crew, he paints murals and live sets as well as canvas, and has held solo exhibitions including 《PINK CITY》 (Modu's Gallery, Incheon, 2025), 《Hedon is Everywhere》 (Docent Gallery, Gimhae, 2025), 《천사 타락 작전 / Angel Fall Operation》 (WWD Gallery, Daejeon, 2025) and 《오늘부터 아기로 살겠습니다 / From Today, I Will Live as a Baby》 (Korea Manhwa Museum, Bucheon, 2026), alongside group shows such as 《연결된 서울 / Connected Seoul》 (BS Gallery, Seoul, 2026).",
  "characters": [
   {
    "name": "Hanzel",
    "nameKo": "헨젤",
    "role": "Baby angel",
    "descEn": "Love's sweet and devoted face — the wish to be loved, and the tenderness of giving it."
   },
   {
    "name": "Hevil",
    "nameKo": "헤빌",
    "role": "Baby demon",
    "descEn": "Love's appetite and its bite — desire, temptation and the mischief inside affection."
   }
  ]
 },
